No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

Catalogue entries (bill number, title, Royal Assent date) are facts recorded in the Votes and
Proceedings of the Legislative Assembly of Saskatchewan (https://www.legassembly.sk.ca). No text of
those documents is reproduced.

The "legal-system" facts come from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), released under CC0 1.0.

The statutes of Saskatchewan are published by the King's Printer (Publications Saskatchewan,
https://publications.saskatchewan.ca), whose terms prohibit redistribution without a written
copyright release. They are not copied here.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
